OL,3,GNEWSARoad sign corrected after Britain
OL,4,Aspelt incorrectly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has had to rectify an error
OL,7,Fon a road sign after the word 'Britain'
OL,8,Fwas incorrectly spelt.
OL,10,FBristol City Council workers applied a
OL,11,Fpatch to the brown road sign near
OL,12,FTemple Meads train station that
OL,13,Fdirected motorists towards the ss Great
OL,14,FBritain.
OL,16,FThe sign initially read 'ss Great
OL,17,FBritian' before the mistake was fixed
OL,18,Fwith a patch featuring the letters in
OL,19,Fthe correct order.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
